# ----------------------- Third-party mods (integration testing) -------------------------
# The RemoteTech, InfernalRobotics and KerbalAlarmClock services wrap these mods, and the
# SpaceCenter Parachute class wraps RealChute. They are installed into GameData by
# `krpc-install --mods=...` for the integration tests, and are not part of the release. Each
